<title>USA: Ambanc Corp votes five pct, reg stk divs.</title>
<headline>Ambanc Corp votes five pct, reg stk divs.</headline>
<dateline>VINCENNES, Ind. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambanc Corp said Monday its board voted a five percent stock dividend payable December 2, to holders of record November 20.</p>
<p>In addition, the bank holding company said it voted its regular quarterly dividend of $0.21 per share payable November 8, record October 29.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
